    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_b50f2594",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a large swarm of grasshoppers, with overlaid text suggesting a conspiracy theory that tornadoes are secretly created by the government to destroy them. This is a satirical or absurd meme using juxtaposition to mock conspiracy theories. While not targeting any specific group with hate or abuse, it promotes a baseless and potentially dangerous conspiracy narrative that could mislead viewers into believing in false government actions. The intent is to provoke humor or skepticism by presenting an implausible scenario, but the underlying message can contribute to misinformation and distrust in institutions, which is harmful to societal discourse.",
