      "instance_name": "government_conspiracy_theory",
      "label": "Government Conspiracy Theory",
      "description": "The meme references the idea that governments secretly create natural disasters like tornadoes. This is a type of conspiracy theory that implies hidden, nefarious control by state actors over natural phenomena, often to achieve political or economic goals. It draws on real-world distrust of government institutions and the belief that official narratives are manipulated.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
