      "description": "The meme targets individuals who are drawn to or engage with government conspiracy theories, particularly those who believe in hidden, nefarious government actions. The absurd premise of the meme — that tornadoes are secretly created to destroy grasshoppers — is designed to satirize and mock such belief systems, making it most effective for an audience familiar with or skeptical of conspiracy narratives.",
